          <article class="kst-card kst-sage">
            <div class="kst-eb">For organizations</div>
            <h3>If your organization commissions the work</h3>
            <div class="kst-price kst-price-text"><strong>Fee by arrangement</strong></div>
            <p class="kst-p">Coaching for employees and managers as well as individual, team and group supervision. After a scoping meeting, you will receive a written offer. The fee depends on:</p>
            <ul class="kst-dots">
              <li>Scope and duration of the assignment</li>
              <li>Number, length and rhythm of the sessions</li>
              <li>Group size</li>
              <li>Preparation, follow-up, and scoping and evaluation meetings</li>
              <li>Location of the sessions, travel and travel time</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="kst-p kst-p-s">I also conduct group and team supervision on site at your organization's location.</p>
            <div class="kst-note">Currently, no VAT is charged pursuant to § 19 UStG (German small business regulation).</div>
            <div class="kst-card-first">
              <div class="kst-eb">Initial contact and scoping meeting · free of charge</div>
              <p class="kst-first-lead">After initial contact, I hold a scoping meeting with those responsible. In it, we clarify the occasion, goals, scope and framework.</p>
              <p class="kst-first-p">For group and team supervision, for example on cases, leadership questions or collaboration in the team, an introductory meeting of about 60 minutes is possible if needed. If a collaboration follows, it is charged as a regular session; otherwise it remains free of charge.</p>
              <div class="kst-btns">
                <a class="kst-btn kst-btn-grad" href="mailto:info@stefangowitzke.de"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"/></svg>Inquire by email</a>
                <a class="kst-btn kst-btn-out" href="tel:+4915734640439"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>Inquire by phone</a>
