      <div class="rd-inner">
        <div class="kst-qa">
          <h2 class="kst-qh">Questions about costs and process</h2>
          <div class="kst-acc">
  <div class="kst-acc-item is-open">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="kst-acc-t">Is the content treated confidentially, even if my organization pays the costs?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>For supervision or coaching of employees, we agree on the goals together with the supervision participants or the person being coached and, where applicable, with the managers responsible in the organization.</p><p>In principle, the content of the sessions remains confidential. As part of clarifying the assignment, the participants agree transparently which information is passed on, and in what form, to management or the HR department.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="kst-acc-item">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="false"><span class="kst-acc-t">Can my employer cover the costs?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>Many employers fund coaching or supervision as part of staff development. Feel free to approach your manager or the HR department. If your employer covers the costs, the terms for organizations apply, and I coordinate the framework directly with those responsible.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="kst-acc-item">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="false"><span class="kst-acc-t">Are there charges if I cancel an appointment?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>You can cancel free of charge up to 48 hours before the agreed appointment. If you cancel later, I charge the full fee, as an appointment usually cannot be rebooked at short notice. If I manage to rebook it, no costs are incurred.</p><p>For organizations, different cancellation rules may apply. We agree on these in the offer.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="kst-acc-item">
    <button class="kst-acc-q" aria-expanded="false"><span class="kst-acc-t">How and when do I receive the invoice?</span><span class="faq-toggle"></span></button>
    <div class="kst-acc-a"><div class="kst-acc-a-inner"><p>You receive the invoice for the agreed sessions by the end of each month. For organizations, the payment terms agreed in the offer apply.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div>
